  "details": "VRChat Wiki is displaying a message with an incorrect HTTP 403 Forbidden response code: \"We will be back soon! We are currently under maintenance.\" HTTP 403 Forbidden seems to be semantically incorrect for scheduled maintenance, the HTTP 503 Service Unavailable response code is made for that.\n\nAffected URL: https://wiki.vrchat.com/\n\nExpected result: HTTP 503 Service Unavailable\n\nActual result: HTTP 403 Forbidden\n\nSee: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Status/503\n\nRelated: https://status.vrchat.com/incidents/xg3n4y6875w6",
